; The subtree of Assets:Cash holds 13 USD, so asserting the 1 USD the
; account holds itself fails.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash:Sub
2020-01-01 open Equity:O

2020-01-06 * "to the account and a subaccount"
  Assets:Cash        1 USD
  Assets:Cash:Sub   12 USD
  Equity:O

2020-01-07 balance Assets:Cash 1 USD
